{"sourceUrl":"https://ibms.suda.edu.cn/de/53/c3465a712275/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:52.154495+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ibms.suda.edu.cn/de/53/c3465a712275/page.htm","html":"<div><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>苏州大学生物医学研究院</span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>2027</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>年推荐免试研究生</strong></span></span><span><span>预报名工作已于近日开展，现将具体事项通知如下：</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>招生专业</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>全日制研究生招生专业：</span></span></span></span><span><span>071000</span></span><span><span><span><span>生物学、</span></span></span></span><span><span>100100</span></span><span><span><span><span>基础医学、</span></span></span></span><span><span>086001</span></span><span><span><span><span>生物技术与工程</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>申请条件</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span> 1</span></span><span><span><span><span>．获得本科所在学校推荐免试资格的</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>届本科毕业生；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 2</span></span><span><span><span><span>．品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>网上报名</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>预报名时间：</span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>2026</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>8</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>15</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>日—</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>2026</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>15</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>有意向申请我院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span><span><span>年推免研究生的本科生（包括本校和外校），请登录“研究生报考服务系统”</span></span></span></span><span><span>(http://gsas.yjs.suda.edu.cn)</span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><strong><span>生物医学研究院简介</span></strong></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>苏州大学生物医学研究院（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>Institutes of Biology and Medical Sciences</span></span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>IBMS</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>坐落于风景秀丽的苏州工业园区独墅湖畔，</span></span></span><span><span><span>是苏州大学于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2010</span></span><span><span><span><span>年由熊思东教授领衔组建成立的校级科研机构，挂靠苏州大学苏州医学院。其研究工作基础是基于苏州大学免疫学科和病原生物学科，是苏州大学免疫学科主要依托单位。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>学科实力雄厚，免疫学</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>ESI</span></span><span><span><span><span>全球排名前</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1%</span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>IBMS</span></span><span><span><span><span>立足苏州大学相关学科的已有基础和特色，致力于探索核酸抗原免疫识别、应答与调控机制，发掘感染性疾病、自身免疫病和肿瘤的发病机理，并提出疾病防治新策略。免疫学科</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>ESI</span></span><span><span><span><span>全球排名前</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1%</span></span><span><span><span><span>。研究院拥有江苏省感染与免疫重点实验室、苏州市抗肿瘤生物技术药物重点实验室、苏州市治疗性抗体及其关键技术重点实验室等多个省市级重点科研平台。同时，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>IBMS</span></span><span><span><span><span>自建国家</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>P2+</span></span><span><span><span><span>实验室，并与德国杜塞尔多夫大学医学部共建国际感染与免疫研究所。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>师资力量卓越，高水平导师团队引领。</span></span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>IBMS</span></span><span><span><span><span>现有全职在岗教职工</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>50</span></span><span><span><span><span>人，其中正教授</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span><span><span>人、副教授及讲师</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span><span><span>人、统招博士后</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>名、专技人员</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>16</span></span><span><span><span><span>人，在读硕士和博士研究生</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>150</span></span><span><span><span><span>余名。研究院拥有国家杰青</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>人、国家海外高层次人才</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>人、国家海外优青</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>人、教育部青年长江</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>人、江苏特聘教授</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>人、江苏省杰青</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>人、江苏省双创人才</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>人、江苏省</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>333</span></span><span><span><span><span>工程培养对象</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>人。研究院先后获批教育部创新团队、中央财政支持地方高校专项—生物医药创新团队、江苏省创新团队</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>个、江苏省高校青蓝工程科技创新团队等。各学术团队主要围绕基础免疫学、糖免疫生物学、感染免疫学、肿瘤免疫学、自身免疫及自身免疫病等方面开展研究工作。建院以来，已培养博士研究生</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>115</span></span><span><span><span><span>名、硕士研究生</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>402</span></span><span><span><span><span>名，连续荣获国家研究生教育成果奖一等奖和二等奖。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>科研平台先进，硬件设施一流。</span></span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>IBMS</span></span><span><span><span><span>办公及实验室面积约</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>5000</span></span><span><span><span><span>平方米，除各课题组独立实验空间外，另设有</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>SPF</span></span><span><span><span><span>级动物房、细胞培养室和</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>P2</span></span><span><span><span><span>实验室等公用实验室。研究院为各科研团队构建了光学成像平台、蛋白质组学平台、细胞分选平台等，配备双光子荧光显微镜、激光共聚焦显微镜、流式细胞分选仪、高效气液相色谱仪、高分辨率小动物超声影像系统等国际先进的科研设备，总固定资产超过</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>5000</span></span><span><span><span><span>万元人民币。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>科研成果丰硕，人才培养成效显著。</span></span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span><span><span><span>自建院以来，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>IBMS</span></span><span><span><span><span>先后承担国家级、省部级及市厅级纵向科研项目</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>290</span></span><span><span><span><span>余项、横向科研项目</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span><span><span>余项。获批国家自然科学基金</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>134</span></span><span><span><span><span>项，其中杰青</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>项、海外优青</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>项、国际交流合作项目</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>项、国自然重点项目</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>项、新冠专项</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>项、综合研究专项</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>项、重大研究计划培育项目</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>项、面上项目</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>79</span></span><span><span><span><span>项、青年基金</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>41</span></span><span><span><span><span>项；承担科技部项目十余项，包括作为首席承担“十一五”、“十二五”重大专项、参与“十三五”重大专项课题</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>项、</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>973</span></span><span><span><span><span>项目课题</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>项、国家重点研发计划课题</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>项，获批纵向经费及人才项目经费超</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>亿元、横向经费近</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2000</span></span><span><span><span><span>万元。已在感染免疫、自身免疫和肿瘤免疫研究领域取得系列原创成果，发表</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>SCI</span></span><span><span><span><span>收录论文</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>600</span></span><span><span><span><span>余篇，近五年以</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>IBMS</span></span><span><span><span><span>为第一单位在</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>Nature</span></span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>Cell</span></span><span><span><span><span>等顶刊发表重要研究成果。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span>热忱</span></span></span><span><span><span>欢迎全国各高校获得推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生踊跃报考苏州大学生物医学研究院！请通过苏州大学生物医学研究院师资介绍网址</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>https://ibms.suda.edu.cn/szlb/list.htm</span></span><span><span><span><span>了解我们，欢迎考生与导师直接沟通交流！</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span>咨询方式：</span></strong></span><span><span><strong>0512-65882135</strong></span><span><strong>，李老师，</strong></span><span><strong>lixin1994@suda.edu.cn</strong></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"896a6ae68b2935b1afba06b0c8f3c8bc3330b09befee324be1e9ac37ada8e188","textLength":1682,"sourceSha256":"cafdc71f014eb5151903a57615764f6c7ff951bf787ecdf274e992b916377ed3","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-13449ead1a3f8456a7c4","title":"2026年苏州大学生物医学研究院2027年推荐免试研究生欢迎报考","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:52.154495+00:00"}
